  m_Name: Text_QuarryWorker_Waiting
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Game.Dialogue.TextDialogueNode
  text: Any luck? No, I can see it on you. Pick the lock if you've the skill, or lift Dace's key from his hut while he's out on the floor. And if you go round by the goat track, take a proper weapon. I mean it.
